[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     98[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   distinguished from EOF. Covered by `unreadable_stdin_is_input_failure`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     99[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * **`argv` is ignored.** Covered by `command_line_arguments_are_ignored`.
